{"id":"sluchajno","lemma":"случайно","pos":"adv","rank":592,"glosses":["accidentally, by accident","randomly, casually","by chance, unpredictably"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%83%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%83%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты, случайно, не боишься меня?","en":"Are you, by any chance, afraid of me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/681271","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Ты её вчера, случайно, не видел?","en":"Did you happen to see her yesterday?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"her"},{"g":"yesterday"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"}]},{"text":"Ты, случайно, не знаешь, что случилось?","en":"Do you happen to know what happened?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"}]},{"text":"Это было не случайно.","en":"It was no accident.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Это случилось совершенно случайно.","en":"It happened completely by accident.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"},{"g":"perfectly"},null]}]}